        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/44368997?u=f0a0c9f923d7c1e2159d23175cfb4e0e1bb0cbf6&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Bug description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The view progress scroll timeline example is broken on MDN playground because it uses absolute units (stumped me for quite a bit!). Here's a screenshot of how it looks like before my changes on Chrome v140:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490568499-3bea9592-436d-4d9b-9582-109d5b8c1317.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..eI6vBFeEYXN1vkVZdLFrgsA784502_2q5kIF9AjJB4E\"><img width=\"460\" height=\"315\" alt=\"Screenshot before changes\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490568499-3bea9592-436d-4d9b-9582-109d5b8c1317.png?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..eI6vBFeEYXN1vkVZdLFrgsA784502_2q5kIF9AjJB4E\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 315px;\"></a>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Fix</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I've updated the example to use percentage units instead of absolute units. Here's a screen recording with my fix:</p>\n<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490566885-64cfb7d5-d529-4936-a45d-31358010e0d3.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kq3g09dT04tmM8NqTdkPYBtmI40JSVTll6BFquKwAXI\"><img width=\"460\" height=\"315\" alt=\"Screen recording with my changes\" src=\"https://private-user-images.githubusercontent.com/44368997/490566885-64cfb7d5-d529-4936-a45d-31358010e0d3.gif?jwt=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..kq3g09dT04tmM8NqTdkPYBtmI40JSVTll6BFquKwAXI\" data-animated-image=\"\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: 315px;\"></a>",
