            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/69888?v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">The attribute is baseline 2023 / fully supported, so the plugin and fully supported text is no longer needed.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">There is  a bug in safari that allows in content search on inert content, which demoted safari support, but it is supported otherwise.</p>",
