        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47647?u=2fbfc431a85d357f00c0146d5e55b425b7f00a3d&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Chrome 141 adds support for the <code class=\"notranslate\">ariaNotify()</code> method; see <a href=\"https://chromestatus.com/feature/5745430754230272\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://chromestatus.com/feature/5745430754230272</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This method is currently non-standard, but will be added to the specs imminently; see <a class=\"issue-link js-issue-link\" data-error-text=\"Failed to load title\" data-id=\"3236964762\" data-permission-text=\"Title is private\" data-url=\"https://github.com/w3c/aria/issues/2577\" data-hovercard-type=\"pull_request\" data-hovercard-url=\"/w3c/aria/pull/2577/hovercard\" href=\"https://github.com/w3c/aria/pull/2577\">w3c/aria#2577</a>.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">This PR adds:</p>\n<ul class=\"contains-task-list\">\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Completed task\" checked=\"\"> A new <code class=\"notranslate\">Document.ariaNotify()</code> page</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> A new <code class=\"notranslate\">Element.ariaNotify()</code> page</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> A new <code class=\"notranslate\">aria-notify</code> permissions policy directive page</li>\n<li class=\"task-list-item\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"\" disabled=\"\" class=\"task-list-item-checkbox\" aria-label=\"Incomplete task\"> Possibly a mention of it in a few other places, such as the ARIA live regions page.</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Setting this to draft for now, as there are still some functionality details to be worked out in tests.</p>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
